<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hi Erwin,<br><br>Just a slight problem with the libbullet project in VC8, it doesn't include btQuickprof.cpp, therefore when you go to use the collision detection lib on its own it gives a few linking errors relating to btQuickprof.<br><br>Hope this helps!<br>Thanks!<br>All the best,<br>Ash</div></blockquote>Hi Ash,<br><br>libbulletcollision.vcproj depends on libbulletmath.vcproj, just include that and you should be fine.<br>Alternatively, comment out the define #USE_QUICKPROF in LinearMath/btQuickProf.h and you are fine.<br><br>Hope this helps,<br>Thanks,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Thu Nov 09, 2006 9:25 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
